msgid "The ``tools``, ``providers``, ``extensions``, ``extensions.server_tools``, ``jit_harness``, and ``sandbox`` packages re-export their main names lazily: a name loads its defining module the first time it is used, so importing the package imports nothing. Every other name is imported from the module that defines it::"
